<style>
  .vg-w-demo-annotated-diagram-walkthrough { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--s-3); margin: var(--s-3) 0 var(--s-4); }
  .vg-w-demo-annotated-diagram-walkthrough > svg { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }
  .vg-w-demo-annotated-diagram-walkthrough input[type="radio"] { position: absolute; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; }
  .vg-w-demo-annotated-diagram-walkthrough .cpn { fill: var(--bg-soft); stroke: var(--muted-2); stroke-width: 1.5; cursor: pointer; transition: fill 200ms, stroke 200ms; }
  .vg-w-demo-annotated-diagram-walkthrough .cpn:hover { stroke: var(--accent); }
  .vg-w-demo-annotated-diagram-walkthrough .cpn:focus { outline: none; }
  .vg-w-demo-annotated-diagram-walkthrough .cpn:focus-visible { outline: none; stroke: var(--accent-text); stroke-width: 2; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .vg-w-demo-annotated-diagram-walkthrough .cpn-text { pointer-events: none; font-family: var(--serif); font-size: var(--fs-xs); fill: var(--ink); }
  .vg-w-demo-annotated-diagram-walkthrough .afford {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5em;
    margin: 0 0 var(--s-2);
    font-family: var(--sans); font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: var(--accent-text);
  }
  .vg-w-demo-annotated-diagram-walkthrough .afford > svg { flex-shrink: 0; display: block; width: 13px; height: 13px; }
  .vg-w-demo-annotated-diagram-walkthrough .detail-container { max-width: 64ch; }
  .vg-w-demo-annotated-diagram-walkthrough .detail { display: none; padding: var(--s-2) var(--s-3); background: var(--bg-soft); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 4px; }
  .vg-w-demo-annotated-diagram-walkthrough .detail h4 { margin: 0 0 var(--s-1); font-family: var(--sans); font-size: var(--fs-xs); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--accent-text); }
  .vg-w-demo-annotated-diagram-walkthrough .detail p { margin: 0; font-family: var(--serif); font-size: var(--fs-sm); color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.55; }
  .vg-w-demo-annotated-diagram-walkthrough:has(#adw-1:checked) .cpn[data-c="1"],
  .vg-w-demo-annotated-diagram-walkthrough:has(#adw-2:checked) .cpn[data-c="2"],
  .vg-w-demo-annotated-diagram-walkthrough:has(#adw-3:checked) .cpn[data-c="3"] {
    fill: rgb(var(--shadow-glow) / 0.18);
    stroke: var(--accent);
  }
  .vg-w-demo-annotated-diagram-walkthrough:has(#adw-1:checked) .detail-1,
  .vg-w-demo-annotated-diagram-walkthrough:has(#adw-2:checked) .detail-2,
  .vg-w-demo-annotated-diagram-walkthrough:has(#adw-3:checked) .detail-3 { display: block; }

  /* Layout swap: horizontal flow at desktop, vertical stack on phones so each
     <rect> stays well above the 44×44 tap-target floor. Both SVGs share the
     same radio state via .cpn[data-c="N"] selectors. Selectors are prefixed
     with `.vg-w-demo-annotated-diagram-walkthrough > svg` to outweigh the base `.vg-w-demo-annotated-diagram-walkthrough > svg { display:
     block }` rule above on specificity. */
  .vg-w-demo-annotated-diagram-walkthrough > svg.vg-w-demo-annotated-diagram-walkthrough__vertical { display: none; }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .vg-w-demo-annotated-diagram-walkthrough > svg.vg-w-demo-annotated-diagram-walkthrough__horizontal { display: none; }
    .vg-w-demo-annotated-diagram-walkthrough > svg.vg-w-demo-annotated-diagram-walkthrough__vertical { display: block; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .vg-w-demo-annotated-diagram-walkthrough .cpn { transition: none; }
  }
</style>
<figure class="vg-w-demo-annotated-diagram-walkthrough">
  <input type="radio" id="adw-1" name="adw-sel" checked />
  <input type="radio" id="adw-2" name="adw-sel" />
  <input type="radio" id="adw-3" name="adw-sel" />
  <p class="afford">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none"
         stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"
         stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="m9 9 5 12 1.8-5.2L21 14Z"/>
      <path d="M7.2 2.2 8 5.1"/><path d="m5.1 8-2.9-.8"/>
      <path d="M14 4.1 12 6"/><path d="m6 12-1.9 2"/>
    </svg>
    <span>點任一方塊 · 共 3 個元件</span>
  </p>
  <svg class="vg-w-demo-annotated-diagram-walkthrough__horizontal" viewBox="0 0 600 140" role="img" aria-label="3-component architecture">
    <rect class="cpn" data-c="1" x="20"  y="40" width="160" height="60" rx="4" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="select ingress" />
    <text class="cpn-text" x="100" y="76" text-anchor="middle">ingress</text>
    <line x1="180" y1="70" x2="220" y2="70" stroke="var(--muted-2)" />
    <rect class="cpn" data-c="2" x="220" y="40" width="160" height="60" rx="4" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="select router" />
    <text class="cpn-text" x="300" y="76" text-anchor="middle">router</text>
    <line x1="380" y1="70" x2="420" y2="70" stroke="var(--muted-2)" />
    <rect class="cpn" data-c="3" x="420" y="40" width="160" height="60" rx="4" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="select worker" />
    <text class="cpn-text" x="500" y="76" text-anchor="middle">worker</text>
  </svg>
  <svg class="vg-w-demo-annotated-diagram-walkthrough__vertical" viewBox="0 0 160 240" role="img" aria-label="3-component architecture">
    <rect class="cpn" data-c="1" x="20" y="20"  width="120" height="60" rx="4" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="select ingress" />
    <text class="cpn-text" x="80" y="56" text-anchor="middle">ingress</text>
    <line x1="80" y1="80"  x2="80" y2="100" stroke="var(--muted-2)" />
    <rect class="cpn" data-c="2" x="20" y="100" width="120" height="60" rx="4" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="select router" />
    <text class="cpn-text" x="80" y="136" text-anchor="middle">router</text>
    <line x1="80" y1="160" x2="80" y2="180" stroke="var(--muted-2)" />
    <rect class="cpn" data-c="3" x="20" y="180" width="120" height="60" rx="4" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="select worker" />
    <text class="cpn-text" x="80" y="216" text-anchor="middle">worker</text>
  </svg>
  <div class="detail-container">
    <div class="detail detail-1"><h4>Ingress</h4><p>接收外部 request、TLS 終止、rate-limit。不知道路由規則，只負責把連線丟給 router。</p></div>
    <div class="detail detail-2"><h4>Router</h4><p>查路由表決定該打哪個 worker pool；維護 sticky session、health check 黑名單。沒有業務邏輯。</p></div>
    <div class="detail detail-3"><h4>Worker</h4><p>實際處理 request 的單元；無狀態、可水平擴；不知道自己被哪個 router 派來。</p></div>
  </div>
  <script>
    (function() {
      const root = document.currentScript.closest('.vg-w-demo-annotated-diagram-walkthrough');
      root.querySelectorAll('.cpn').forEach(el => {
        const idx = el.getAttribute('data-c');
        el.addEventListener('click', () => { root.querySelector('#adw-' + idx).checked = true; });
        el.addEventListener('keydown', e => {
          if (e.key === 'Enter' || e.key === ' ') { e.preventDefault(); el.click(); }
        });
      });
    })();
  </script>
</figure>
